1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,639
As Uke comes to grab your wrist with both hands

2
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:03,807
extend towards him

3
00:00:03,808 --> 00:00:07,117
using his momentum bring him around 
in a big circular motion

4
00:00:07,418 --> 00:00:10,469
as he does so control his opposite arm,

5
00:00:10,470 --> 00:00:12,836
turning the hip sharply to break his balance

6
00:00:13,237 --> 00:00:15,718
step forward controlling his wrist and elbow,

7
00:00:16,219 --> 00:00:18,539
as you bring him down, control the arm

8
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:21,076
putting his shoulder in between the knees

9
00:00:21,077 --> 00:00:22,242
controlling his wrist

10
00:00:23,043 --> 00:00:24,674
keep that close against the body,

11
00:00:24,675 --> 00:00:27,009
turning your body towards his head for the pin.

